{
  "book": "alma",
  "bookName": "Alma",
  "chapter": 19,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 606.164,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 3.483,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that after two days and two nights",
      "verse": "19:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 3.663,
      "end": 7.192,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they were about to take his body and lay it in a sepulchre,",
      "verse": "19:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 7.372,
      "end": 11.087,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which they had made for the purpose of burying their dead.",
      "verse": "19:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 11.767,
      "end": 14.786,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now the queen having heard of the fame of Ammon,",
      "verse": "19:2",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 14.966,
      "end": 18.867,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore she sent and desired that he should come in unto her.",
      "verse": "19:2",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 19.547,
      "end": 22.705,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that Ammon did as he was commanded,",
      "verse": "19:3",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 22.885,
      "end": 24.696,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and went in unto the queen,",
      "verse": "19:3",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 24.876,
      "end": 28.127,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and desired to know what she would that he should do.",
      "verse": "19:3",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 28.807,
      "end": 30.34,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And she said unto him:",
      "verse": "19:4",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 30.52,
      "end": 33.353,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "The servants of my husband have made it known unto me",
      "verse": "19:4",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 33.533,
      "end": 36.273,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that thou art a prophet of a holy God,",
      "verse": "19:4",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 36.453,
      "end": 40.168,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that thou hast power to do many mighty works in his name;",
      "verse": "19:4",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 40.848,
      "end": 42.659,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore, if this is the case,",
      "verse": "19:5",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 42.839,
      "end": 45.765,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I would that ye should go in and see my husband,",
      "verse": "19:5",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 45.945,
      "end": 51.471,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for he has been laid upon his bed for the space of two days and two nights;",
      "verse": "19:5",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 51.651,
      "end": 53.927,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and some say that he is not dead,",
      "verse": "19:5",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 54.107,
      "end": 56.615,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but others say that he is dead",
      "verse": "19:5",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 56.795,
      "end": 58.235,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that he stinketh,",
      "verse": "19:5",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 58.415,
      "end": 61.712,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that he ought to be placed in the sepulchre;",
      "verse": "19:5",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 61.892,
      "end": 64.446,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but as for myself, to me he doth not stink.",
      "verse": "19:5",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 65.126,
      "end": 67.402,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now, this was what Ammon desired,",
      "verse": "19:6",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 67.582,
      "end": 71.251,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for he knew that king Lamoni was under the power of God;",
      "verse": "19:6",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 71.431,
      "end": 76.168,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he knew that the dark veil of unbelief was being cast away from his mind,",
      "verse": "19:6",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 76.348,
      "end": 81.781,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the light which did light up his mind, which was the light of the glory of God,",
      "verse": "19:6",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 81.961,
      "end": 84.98,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which was a marvelous light of his goodness\u2014",
      "verse": "19:6",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 85.16,
      "end": 88.457,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, this light had infused such joy into his soul,",
      "verse": "19:6",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 88.637,
      "end": 91.191,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the cloud of darkness having been dispelled,",
      "verse": "19:6",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 91.371,
      "end": 96.247,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that the light of everlasting life was lit up in his soul,",
      "verse": "19:6",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 96.427,
      "end": 100.142,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, he knew that this had overcome his natural frame,",
      "verse": "19:6",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 100.322,
      "end": 102.272,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he was carried away in God\u2014",
      "verse": "19:6",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 102.952,
      "end": 106.342,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore, what the queen desired of him was his only desire.",
      "verse": "19:7",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 106.522,
      "end": 108.983,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore, he went in to see the king",
      "verse": "19:7",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 109.163,
      "end": 111.717,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "according as the queen had desired him;",
      "verse": "19:7",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 111.897,
      "end": 113.383,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he saw the king,",
      "verse": "19:7",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 113.563,
      "end": 115.746,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he knew that he was not dead.",
      "verse": "19:7",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 116.426,
      "end": 118.051,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he said unto the queen:",
      "verse": "19:8",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 118.231,
      "end": 120.785,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "He is not dead, but he sleepeth in God,",
      "verse": "19:8",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 120.965,
      "end": 123.194,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and on the morrow he shall rise again;",
      "verse": "19:8",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 123.374,
      "end": 124.953,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore bury him not.",
      "verse": "19:8",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 125.633,
      "end": 127.258,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And Ammon said unto her:",
      "verse": "19:9",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 127.438,
      "end": 129.11,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Believest thou this?",
      "verse": "19:9",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 129.29,
      "end": 130.823,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And she said unto him:",
      "verse": "19:9",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 131.003,
      "end": 133.557,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I have had no witness save thy word,",
      "verse": "19:9",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 133.737,
      "end": 135.641,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the word of our servants;",
      "verse": "19:9",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 135.821,
      "end": 139.954,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "nevertheless I believe that it shall be according as thou hast said.",
      "verse": "19:9",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 140.634,
      "end": 142.259,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And Ammon said unto her:",
      "verse": "19:10",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 142.439,
      "end": 145.55,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Blessed art thou because of thy exceeding faith;",
      "verse": "19:10",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 145.73,
      "end": 147.448,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I say unto thee, woman,",
      "verse": "19:10",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 147.628,
      "end": 152.365,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "there has not been such great faith among all the people of the Nephites.",
      "verse": "19:10",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 153.045,
      "end": 160.475,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that she watched over the bed of her husband, from that time even until that time on the morrow",
      "verse": "19:11",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 160.655,
      "end": 163.72,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which Ammon had appointed that he should rise.",
      "verse": "19:11",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 164.4,
      "end": 169.044,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that he arose, according to the words of Ammon;",
      "verse": "19:12",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 169.224,
      "end": 172.661,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and as he arose, he stretched forth his hand unto the woman,",
      "verse": "19:12",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 172.841,
      "end": 174.002,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and said:",
      "verse": "19:12",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 174.182,
      "end": 177.247,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Blessed be the name of God, and blessed art thou.",
      "verse": "19:12",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 177.927,
      "end": 179.877,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For as sure as thou livest,",
      "verse": "19:13",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 180.057,
      "end": 182.425,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold, I have seen my Redeemer;",
      "verse": "19:13",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 182.605,
      "end": 185.624,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he shall come forth, and be born of a woman,",
      "verse": "19:13",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 185.804,
      "end": 189.101,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he shall redeem all mankind who believe on his name.",
      "verse": "19:13",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 189.281,
      "end": 194.157,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now, when he had said these words, his heart was swollen within him,",
      "verse": "19:13",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 194.337,
      "end": 196.473,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he sunk again with joy;",
      "verse": "19:13",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 196.653,
      "end": 200.415,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the queen also sunk down, being overpowered by the Spirit.",
      "verse": "19:13",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 201.095,
      "end": 207.318,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now Ammon seeing the Spirit of the Lord poured out according to his prayers upon the Lamanites, his brethren,",
      "verse": "19:14",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 207.498,
      "end": 211.585,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who had been the cause of so much mourning among the Nephites,",
      "verse": "19:14",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 211.765,
      "end": 217.013,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or among all the people of God because of their iniquities and their traditions,",
      "verse": "19:14",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 217.193,
      "end": 218.865,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he fell upon his knees,",
      "verse": "19:14",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 219.045,
      "end": 221.321,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and began to pour out his soul",
      "verse": "19:14",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 221.501,
      "end": 225.82,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "in prayer and thanksgiving to God for what he had done for his brethren;",
      "verse": "19:14",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 226.0,
      "end": 228.368,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he was also overpowered with joy;",
      "verse": "19:14",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 228.548,
      "end": 231.381,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and thus they all three had sunk to the earth.",
      "verse": "19:14",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 232.061,
      "end": 236.333,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now, when the servants of the king had seen that they had fallen,",
      "verse": "19:15",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 236.513,
      "end": 238.835,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they also began to cry unto God,",
      "verse": "19:15",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 239.015,
      "end": 242.126,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for the fear of the Lord had come upon them also,",
      "verse": "19:15",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 242.306,
      "end": 249.597,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for it was they who had stood before the king and testified unto him concerning the great power of Ammon.",
      "verse": "19:15",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 250.277,
      "end": 255.014,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that they did call on the name of the Lord, in their might,",
      "verse": "19:16",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 255.194,
      "end": 257.888,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even until they had all fallen to the earth,",
      "verse": "19:16",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 258.068,
      "end": 260.947,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "save it were one of the Lamanitish women,",
      "verse": "19:16",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 261.127,
      "end": 262.985,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "whose name was Abish,",
      "verse": "19:16",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 263.165,
      "end": 269.899,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "she having been converted unto the Lord for many years, on account of a remarkable vision of her father\u2014",
      "verse": "19:16",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 270.579,
      "end": 273.04,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Thus, having been converted to the Lord,",
      "verse": "19:17",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 273.22,
      "end": 275.17,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and never having made it known,",
      "verse": "19:17",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 275.35,
      "end": 280.551,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore, when she saw that all the servants of Lamoni had fallen to the earth,",
      "verse": "19:17",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 280.731,
      "end": 286.49,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also her mistress, the queen, and the king, and Ammon lay prostrate upon the earth,",
      "verse": "19:17",
      "lineIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "start": 286.67,
      "end": 288.992,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "she knew that it was the power of God;",
      "verse": "19:17",
      "lineIndex": 85
    },
    {
      "start": 289.172,
      "end": 291.448,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and supposing that this opportunity,",
      "verse": "19:17",
      "lineIndex": 86
    },
    {
      "start": 291.628,
      "end": 295.575,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "by making known unto the people what had happened among them,",
      "verse": "19:17",
      "lineIndex": 87
    },
    {
      "start": 295.755,
      "end": 297.798,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that by beholding this scene",
      "verse": "19:17",
      "lineIndex": 88
    },
    {
      "start": 297.978,
      "end": 300.857,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "it would cause them to believe in the power of God,",
      "verse": "19:17",
      "lineIndex": 89
    },
    {
      "start": 301.037,
      "end": 306.053,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore she ran forth from house to house, making it known unto the people.",
      "verse": "19:17",
      "lineIndex": 90
    },
    {
      "start": 306.733,
      "end": 311.423,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they began to assemble themselves together unto the house of the king.",
      "verse": "19:18",
      "lineIndex": 91
    },
    {
      "start": 311.603,
      "end": 313.414,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And there came a multitude,",
      "verse": "19:18",
      "lineIndex": 92
    },
    {
      "start": 313.594,
      "end": 320.792,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and to their astonishment, they beheld the king, and the queen, and their servants prostrate upon the earth,",
      "verse": "19:18",
      "lineIndex": 93
    },
    {
      "start": 320.972,
      "end": 323.712,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they all lay there as though they were dead;",
      "verse": "19:18",
      "lineIndex": 94
    },
    {
      "start": 323.892,
      "end": 325.75,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they also saw Ammon,",
      "verse": "19:18",
      "lineIndex": 95
    },
    {
      "start": 325.93,
      "end": 327.695,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and behold, he was a Nephite.",
      "verse": "19:18",
      "lineIndex": 96
    },
    {
      "start": 328.375,
      "end": 331.672,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now the people began to murmur among themselves;",
      "verse": "19:19",
      "lineIndex": 97
    },
    {
      "start": 331.852,
      "end": 335.428,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "some saying that it was a great evil that had come upon them,",
      "verse": "19:19",
      "lineIndex": 98
    },
    {
      "start": 335.608,
      "end": 337.791,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or upon the king and his house,",
      "verse": "19:19",
      "lineIndex": 99
    },
    {
      "start": 337.971,
      "end": 341.965,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "because he had suffered that the Nephite should remain in the land.",
      "verse": "19:19",
      "lineIndex": 100
    },
    {
      "start": 342.645,
      "end": 345.06,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But others rebuked them, saying:",
      "verse": "19:20",
      "lineIndex": 101
    },
    {
      "start": 345.24,
      "end": 348.259,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "The king hath brought this evil upon his house,",
      "verse": "19:20",
      "lineIndex": 102
    },
    {
      "start": 348.439,
      "end": 350.204,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "because he slew his servants",
      "verse": "19:20",
      "lineIndex": 103
    },
    {
      "start": 350.384,
      "end": 354.192,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who had had their flocks scattered at the waters of Sebus.",
      "verse": "19:20",
      "lineIndex": 104
    },
    {
      "start": 354.872,
      "end": 363.371,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they were also rebuked by those men who had stood at the waters of Sebus and scattered the flocks which belonged to the king,",
      "verse": "19:21",
      "lineIndex": 105
    },
    {
      "start": 363.551,
      "end": 373.025,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they were angry with Ammon because of the number which he had slain of their brethren at the waters of Sebus, while defending the flocks of the king.",
      "verse": "19:21",
      "lineIndex": 106
    },
    {
      "start": 373.705,
      "end": 377.792,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now, one of them, whose brother had been slain with the sword of Ammon,",
      "verse": "19:22",
      "lineIndex": 107
    },
    {
      "start": 377.972,
      "end": 381.827,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "being exceedingly angry with Ammon, drew his sword and went forth",
      "verse": "19:22",
      "lineIndex": 108
    },
    {
      "start": 382.007,
      "end": 385.444,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he might let it fall upon Ammon, to slay him;",
      "verse": "19:22",
      "lineIndex": 109
    },
    {
      "start": 385.624,
      "end": 389.386,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and as he lifted the sword to smite him, behold, he fell dead.",
      "verse": "19:22",
      "lineIndex": 110
    },
    {
      "start": 390.066,
      "end": 392.62,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now we see that Ammon could not be slain,",
      "verse": "19:23",
      "lineIndex": 111
    },
    {
      "start": 392.8,
      "end": 395.958,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for the Lord had said unto Mosiah, his father:",
      "verse": "19:23",
      "lineIndex": 112
    },
    {
      "start": 396.138,
      "end": 400.503,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I will spare him, and it shall be unto him according to thy faith\u2014",
      "verse": "19:23",
      "lineIndex": 113
    },
    {
      "start": 400.683,
      "end": 403.237,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore, Mosiah trusted him unto the Lord.",
      "verse": "19:23",
      "lineIndex": 114
    },
    {
      "start": 403.917,
      "end": 411.812,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that when the multitude beheld that the man had fallen dead, who lifted the sword to slay Ammon,",
      "verse": "19:24",
      "lineIndex": 115
    },
    {
      "start": 411.992,
      "end": 413.942,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "fear came upon them all,",
      "verse": "19:24",
      "lineIndex": 116
    },
    {
      "start": 414.122,
      "end": 417.326,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they durst not put forth their hands to touch him",
      "verse": "19:24",
      "lineIndex": 117
    },
    {
      "start": 417.506,
      "end": 419.689,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or any of those who had fallen;",
      "verse": "19:24",
      "lineIndex": 118
    },
    {
      "start": 419.869,
      "end": 422.655,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they began to marvel again among themselves",
      "verse": "19:24",
      "lineIndex": 119
    },
    {
      "start": 422.835,
      "end": 425.807,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "what could be the cause of this great power,",
      "verse": "19:24",
      "lineIndex": 120
    },
    {
      "start": 425.987,
      "end": 428.216,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or what all these things could mean.",
      "verse": "19:24",
      "lineIndex": 121
    },
    {
      "start": 428.896,
      "end": 434.887,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that there were many among them who said that Ammon was the Great Spirit,",
      "verse": "19:25",
      "lineIndex": 123
    },
    {
      "start": 435.067,
      "end": 438.178,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and others said he was sent by the Great Spirit;",
      "verse": "19:25",
      "lineIndex": 124
    },
    {
      "start": 438.858,
      "end": 445.452,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But others rebuked them all, saying that he was a monster, who had been sent from the Nephites to torment them.",
      "verse": "19:26",
      "lineIndex": 125
    },
    {
      "start": 446.132,
      "end": 452.68,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And there were some who said that Ammon was sent by the Great Spirit to afflict them because of their iniquities;",
      "verse": "19:27",
      "lineIndex": 126
    },
    {
      "start": 452.86,
      "end": 457.736,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that it was the Great Spirit that had always attended the Nephites,",
      "verse": "19:27",
      "lineIndex": 127
    },
    {
      "start": 457.916,
      "end": 460.888,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who had ever delivered them out of their hands;",
      "verse": "19:27",
      "lineIndex": 128
    },
    {
      "start": 461.068,
      "end": 467.941,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they said that it was this Great Spirit who had destroyed so many of their brethren, the Lamanites.",
      "verse": "19:27",
      "lineIndex": 129
    },
    {
      "start": 468.621,
      "end": 472.336,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And thus the contention began to be exceedingly sharp among them.",
      "verse": "19:28",
      "lineIndex": 130
    },
    {
      "start": 472.516,
      "end": 474.884,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And while they were thus contending,",
      "verse": "19:28",
      "lineIndex": 131
    },
    {
      "start": 475.064,
      "end": 479.847,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the woman servant who had caused the multitude to be gathered together came,",
      "verse": "19:28",
      "lineIndex": 132
    },
    {
      "start": 480.027,
      "end": 484.439,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and when she saw the contention which was among the multitude",
      "verse": "19:28",
      "lineIndex": 133
    },
    {
      "start": 484.619,
      "end": 487.823,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "she was exceedingly sorrowful, even unto tears.",
      "verse": "19:28",
      "lineIndex": 134
    },
    {
      "start": 488.503,
      "end": 492.636,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that she went and took the queen by the hand,",
      "verse": "19:29",
      "lineIndex": 135
    },
    {
      "start": 492.816,
      "end": 495.463,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "perhaps she might raise her from the ground;",
      "verse": "19:29",
      "lineIndex": 136
    },
    {
      "start": 495.643,
      "end": 497.593,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and as soon as she touched her hand",
      "verse": "19:29",
      "lineIndex": 137
    },
    {
      "start": 497.773,
      "end": 498.934,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "she arose",
      "verse": "19:29",
      "lineIndex": 138
    },
    {
      "start": 499.114,
      "end": 500.925,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and stood upon her feet,",
      "verse": "19:29",
      "lineIndex": 139
    },
    {
      "start": 501.105,
      "end": 503.241,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and cried with a loud voice, saying:",
      "verse": "19:29",
      "lineIndex": 140
    },
    {
      "start": 503.421,
      "end": 506.997,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "O blessed Jesus, who has saved me from an awful hell!",
      "verse": "19:29",
      "lineIndex": 141
    },
    {
      "start": 507.177,
      "end": 509.824,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "O blessed God, have mercy on this people!",
      "verse": "19:29",
      "lineIndex": 142
    },
    {
      "start": 510.504,
      "end": 517.795,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And when she had said this, she clasped her hands, being filled with joy, speaking many words which were not understood;",
      "verse": "19:30",
      "lineIndex": 143
    },
    {
      "start": 517.975,
      "end": 523.641,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and when she had done this, she took the king, Lamoni, by the hand,",
      "verse": "19:30",
      "lineIndex": 144
    },
    {
      "start": 523.821,
      "end": 526.515,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and behold he arose and stood upon his feet.",
      "verse": "19:30",
      "lineIndex": 145
    },
    {
      "start": 527.195,
      "end": 533.279,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he, immediately, seeing the contention among his people, went forth and began to rebuke them,",
      "verse": "19:31",
      "lineIndex": 146
    },
    {
      "start": 533.459,
      "end": 538.149,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and to teach them the words which he had heard from the mouth of Ammon;",
      "verse": "19:31",
      "lineIndex": 147
    },
    {
      "start": 538.329,
      "end": 540.93,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and as many as heard his words believed,",
      "verse": "19:31",
      "lineIndex": 148
    },
    {
      "start": 541.11,
      "end": 543.339,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and were converted unto the Lord.",
      "verse": "19:31",
      "lineIndex": 149
    },
    {
      "start": 544.019,
      "end": 547.734,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But there were many among them who would not hear his words;",
      "verse": "19:32",
      "lineIndex": 150
    },
    {
      "start": 547.914,
      "end": 549.586,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore they went their way.",
      "verse": "19:32",
      "lineIndex": 151
    },
    {
      "start": 550.266,
      "end": 552.867,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that when Ammon arose",
      "verse": "19:33",
      "lineIndex": 152
    },
    {
      "start": 553.047,
      "end": 555.276,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he also administered unto them,",
      "verse": "19:33",
      "lineIndex": 153
    },
    {
      "start": 555.456,
      "end": 558.103,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also did all the servants of Lamoni;",
      "verse": "19:33",
      "lineIndex": 154
    },
    {
      "start": 558.283,
      "end": 564.46,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they did all declare unto the people the selfsame thing\u2014 that their hearts had been changed;",
      "verse": "19:33",
      "lineIndex": 155
    },
    {
      "start": 564.64,
      "end": 567.055,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they had no more desire to do evil.",
      "verse": "19:33",
      "lineIndex": 156
    },
    {
      "start": 567.735,
      "end": 570.336,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold, many did declare unto the people",
      "verse": "19:34",
      "lineIndex": 157
    },
    {
      "start": 570.516,
      "end": 573.767,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they had seen angels and had conversed with them;",
      "verse": "19:34",
      "lineIndex": 158
    },
    {
      "start": 573.947,
      "end": 578.312,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and thus they had told them things of God, and of his righteousness.",
      "verse": "19:34",
      "lineIndex": 159
    },
    {
      "start": 578.992,
      "end": 583.264,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that there were many that did believe in their words;",
      "verse": "19:35",
      "lineIndex": 160
    },
    {
      "start": 583.444,
      "end": 585.998,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and as many as did believe were baptized;",
      "verse": "19:35",
      "lineIndex": 161
    },
    {
      "start": 586.178,
      "end": 588.546,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they became a righteous people,",
      "verse": "19:35",
      "lineIndex": 162
    },
    {
      "start": 588.726,
      "end": 591.28,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they did establish a church among them.",
      "verse": "19:35",
      "lineIndex": 163
    },
    {
      "start": 591.96,
      "end": 595.768,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And thus the work of the Lord did commence among the Lamanites;",
      "verse": "19:36",
      "lineIndex": 164
    },
    {
      "start": 595.948,
      "end": 599.524,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "thus the Lord did begin to pour out his Spirit upon them;",
      "verse": "19:36",
      "lineIndex": 165
    },
    {
      "start": 599.704,
      "end": 602.815,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and we see that his arm is extended to all people",
      "verse": "19:36",
      "lineIndex": 166
    },
    {
      "start": 602.995,
      "end": 605.503,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who will repent and believe on his name.",
      "verse": "19:36",
      "lineIndex": 167
    }
  ]
}